WEBVTT

vo-01
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.400
Humanity learned to build intelligence.

vo-02
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:09.733
But what happens when the world needs more computing power than it can afford?

vo-03
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.400
Across the world, computing power sits unused,

vo-04
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:21.533
while innovators struggle to access the resources they need.

vo-05
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.733
What if these scattered resources could work together?

vo-06
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:37.467
io.net brings distributed GPU resources together through a decentralized computing network.

vo-07
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.333
Because the next breakthrough might not require building everything from scratch.

vo-08
00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:49.667
It might begin with connecting what already exists.

vo-09
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.733
The world doesn't just need more intelligence.

vo-10
00:00:53.933 --> 00:00:57.333
It needs more ways to power it.
